{
  "name": "develop-story-step-05-qa-budget-spent-ends-on-a-gate",
  "skill": "develop-story",
  "description": "Steps 5–6, the budget counts gates (task.244): five CONCERNS gates with MEDIUM 5, 4, 3, 2, 1 and a budget of 5. Gate 5 still routes to a fix, but a fix may run only when a gate will read it within the budget, so Loop Escalation fires AT gate 5 with its finding open and unfixed — no fifth qa-fix, no gate.6, no review-pr. Fixture records qa-story×5, qa-fix×4. (This scenario was the route-2c half-cycle until task.244 removed that route.)",
  "prompt": "Run steps 5–6 (qa loop) of the develop-story pipeline for story.1.1.1.example. Cycles 1–5 read CONCERNS with HIGH 0 and MEDIUM 5, 4, 3, 2, 1; the budget is 5 gates.",
  "assertions": [
    {
